    <rdfs:comment>Patient_ICU(?p) ^ IndicatedPalliativeCare(?p) ^ hasSymptomBurden(?p,?burden) ^ swrlb:greaterThan(?burden,5) -&gt; ComfortMeasures(?p)</rdfs:comment>
